    "updated_at": "2018-02-20T10:56:21Z",
    "body": "(Note that when scripts execute relative to insertion via `DocumentFragment` is tracked by https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/575 and only Safari is a little different there. Safari executes after the insert of the element, whereas the other browsers execute after the insert operation (which can insert multiple elements as shown above) completes.)",
