    "updated_at": "2018-02-26T14:27:01Z",
    "body": "I consider it a bug that DOM runs the insertion steps so early: https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/576 has a fix; I haven't yet written tests or filed a bug against Safari though. Was waiting for more thorough review since it's a rather substantial change.\r\n\r\nI don't understand what you mean in 3 by the `appendChild()` call being ignored. If I log `doc.body.innerHTML` afterwards it seems like that call very much succeeded.",
