    "body": "> I consider it a bug that DOM runs the insertion steps so early\r\n\r\nActually...  There are complications about running the insertion steps later, in general.  I guess this is only observable with document fragments, so maybe there won't be too much breakage, but it would be a pretty significant behavior change to make _all_ insertion steps run later.",
